    "attributes": {
        "action": "Launch a review into improving women\u2019s hormonal & reproductive care in NHS",
        "additional_details": "Women\u2019s hormonal health can have a profound impact on physical and mental wellbeing, yet symptoms may be overlooked or treated in isolation. This can be particularly difficult during pregnancy, after miscarriage, postnatally and during menopause. Better training, joined-up care and access to evidence-based treatment could help women receive the right support at the right time.",
        "background": "Launch a review into improving NHS care for women\u2019s hormonal and reproductive health by ensuring better training, timely assessment and access to evidence-based treatment for Premenstrual Dysphoric Disorder (PMDD), pregnancy, miscarriage, postnatal health, mental health and menopause.",
